# Lecture 2

### Exploring Tutors

---

## Course Navigation

- Topics organise weekly content
- Units group related resources
- Side bars provide supplementary material
- Breadcrumbs track your location

---

## Learning Resources

- **Labs**: Step-by-step instructions
- **Talks**: Presentations (PDF or Marp)
- **Notes**: Reference pages in markdown
- **Web Links**: External resources

---

## Summary

Tutors provides an intuitive navigation model for discovering and engaging with learning content.
